{
  "id": "E418",
  "title": "Teachers Have Grown Up",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2020-04-01",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming is happy about the progress made by his teachers. Why?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50418/0a6e0671db179e585449a2d0176b85d9c02f7690.mp3?1585482562",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "老师终于长大了\n\n妈妈：小明，你们最近是怎么上网课的？\n小明：很容易。只要有电脑就可以上课了。\n妈妈：上网课和在学校上课一样吗？\n小明：差不多。除了有一次，一个同学在上课的时候睡觉，老师也没办法叫醒他。\n妈妈：老师们也不容易啊。你觉得上网课怎么样？\n小明：挺好的。老师们终于学会了回答自己的问题，他们都长大了。\n",
    "traditional": "老師終於長大了\n\n媽媽：小明，你們最近是怎麼上網課的？\n小明：很容易。只要有電腦就可以上課了。\n媽媽：上網課和在學校上課一樣嗎？\n小明：差不多。除了有一次，一個同學在上課的時候睡覺，老師也沒辦法叫醒他。\n媽媽：老師們也不容易啊。你覺得上網課怎麼樣？\n小明：挺好的。老師們終於學會了回答自己的問題，他們都長大了。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teachers have finally grown up"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "妈妈：小明，你们最近是怎么上网课的？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：小明，你們最近是怎麼上網課的？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma xiǎo míng nǐ men zuì jìn shì zěn me shàng wǎng kè de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mom: Little Ming, how are the online classes you’ve been getting recently?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明：很容易。只要有电脑就可以上课了。",
      "traditional": "小明：很容易。只要有電腦就可以上課了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng hěn róng yì zhǐ yào yǒu diàn nǎo jiù kě yǐ shàng kè le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Very easy. As long as you have a computer, you can attend class."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "妈妈：上网课和在学校上课一样吗？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：上網課和在學校上課一樣嗎？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shàng wǎng kè hé zài xué xiào shàng kè yí yàng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mom: Are online classes the same as classes in school?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明：差不多。",
      "traditional": "小明：差不多。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng chà bu duō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "除了有一次，一个同学在上课的时候睡觉，老师也没办法叫醒他。",
      "traditional": "除了有一次，一個同學在上課的時候睡覺，老師也沒辦法叫醒他。",
      "pinyin": "chú le yǒu yí cì yí ge tóng xué zài shàng kè de shí hou shuì jiào lǎo shī yě méi bàn fǎ jiào xǐng tā",
      "english": "Little Ming: Almost the same."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Except once, when a classmate was sleeping during class, and the teacher had no way to wake him up"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "妈妈：老师们也不容易啊。你觉得上网课怎么样？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：老師們也不容易啊。你覺得上網課怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma lǎo shī men yě bù róng yì a nǐ jué de shàng wǎng kè zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mom: Teachers don’t have it easy either. What do you think of online classes?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小明：挺好的。",
      "traditional": "小明：挺好的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng tǐng hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "老师们终于学会了回答自己的问题，他们都长大了。",
      "traditional": "老師們終於學會了回答自己的問題，他們都長大了。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī men zhōng yú xué huì le huí dá zì jǐ de wèn tí tā men dōu zhǎng dà le",
      "english": "Little Ming: They’re quite good."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The teachers have finally learned to answer their own questions. They’ve all grown up."
    }
  ],
