    "sentence_translations": [
      "Teachers have finally grown up",
      "",
      "Little Ming’s mom: Little Ming, how are the online classes you’ve been getting recently?",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Very easy. As long as you have a computer, you can attend class.",
      "",
      "Little Ming’s mom: Are online classes the same as classes in school?",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Almost the same.",
      "Except once, when a classmate was sleeping during class, and the teacher had no way to wake him up",
      "",
      "Little Ming’s mom: Teachers don’t have it easy either. What do you think of online classes?",
      "",
      "Little Ming: They’re quite good.",
      "The teachers have finally learned to answer their own questions. They’ve all grown up.",
      ""
    ]
